Note on data: the catalog shards in data/catalog/ and the reference documents
in references/ describe datasets published on DATA.GOV.HK by Hong Kong
Government bureaux and departments. That data remains subject to the
DATA.GOV.HK terms of use (https://data.gov.hk/en/terms-and-conditions) and is
included here for discovery/attribution purposes; the MIT licence above covers
the skill's own code and documentation only.
